{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2021-04-20 11:15:00', 'title': 'USDA FOOD SAFETY AND INSPECTION SERVICE CHOOSES 3M FOR CAMPYLOBACTER TESTING IN POULTRY', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN., APRIL 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 3M FOOD SAFETY HAS BEEN AWARDED A CONTRACT FROM THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE FOOD SAFETY AND INSPECTION SERVICE (USDA FSIS) FOR CAMPYLOBACTER 1 \xa0DETECTION WITH THE 3M™ MOLECULAR DETECTION SYSTEM.'}